Universal Bone Meal for Horizon 26.3 (version 0.4.1)

A port of Universal Bone Meal 8.0.1 by Fuzs.
Original source: https://github.com/Fuzss/universalbonemeal-forge
Original licence: MPL-2.0

Ported to Horizon by lavoide: the rules are re-implemented in Rust as a Horizon native mod (the mod API plus
the [[native.mixin]] patches and game modules listed in horizon-mod.toml; no Java code is included). This port is distributed under the same licence as the original (MPL-2.0); the licence text is in LICENSE. Built
against Horizon's exact-build SDK dd67b76ff23e28c6d8e21859df600d31572f81a0.

LICENSE is the original jar's LICENSE.md (MPL-2.0). The original's assets licence (LICENSE-ASSETS.md, All Rights Reserved) doesn't apply: this package carries no assets from it.
